{"3790650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mesorift Survival", "steam_appid": 3790650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/964e7b4cf206b38c9e2a6bb71f760946.avif?t=1785908297\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>— Mesorift Survival —</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mesorift Survival</strong> offers a classic survival experience with an exciting mix of PvP and PvE – set in a dangerous, tropical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open-world map made up of three islands – one large main island and two smaller ones. You'll encounter dense jungle vegetation, abandoned bunker facilities, and old radio towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mesorift Survival</i> is launching in <strong>Early Access (version 0.0.1)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first public build lays the foundation—content, balance, and performance will expand with frequent updates. Your feedback directly shapes development.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Survival Start</strong><br>You begin your journey on the beach – with nothing. Gather wood, stone, and other materials to craft your first tools like an axe and pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b8b1bd2c634bf1187dcc5194593f443f.poster.avif?t=1785908297\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b8b1bd2c634bf1187dcc5194593f443f.webm?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b8b1bd2c634bf1187dcc5194593f443f.mp4?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinosaurs</strong> <br>Due to a failed experiment, dinosaurs are now roaming the island – neither the bunker nor the radio tower facility was spared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/1e8e60effcdcfc4dac89140e4d62fbe8.poster.avif?t=1785908297\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/1e8e60effcdcfc4dac89140e4d62fbe8.webm?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/1e8e60effcdcfc4dac89140e4d62fbe8.mp4?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP and PvE Elements</strong><br>In addition to AI threats, other players can be just as deadly. Will you form alliances or trust no one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/55d5d32921d02557c2985e8d5daf438c.poster.avif?t=1785908297\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/55d5d32921d02557c2985e8d5daf438c.webm?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/55d5d32921d02557c2985e8d5daf438c.mp4?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources &amp; Exploration</strong><br>Venture deeper into the wilderness to discover valuable resources like oil, silver, copper, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b946383193490dbd9a96b1bd6c051176.poster.avif?t=1785908297\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b946383193490dbd9a96b1bd6c051176.webm?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b946383193490dbd9a96b1bd6c051176.mp4?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building &amp; Crafting</strong><br>Construct and upgrade your own base. Craft useful tools and powerful weapons to defend yourself and dominate the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/508774961d8e5fb25ed6ac00227dedbf.poster.avif?t=1785908297\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/508774961d8e5fb25ed6ac00227dedbf.webm?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/508774961d8e5fb25ed6ac00227dedbf.mp4?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the islands faster with various vehicles. Use the trunk for additional storage space and safely transport valuable resources across the map. Mobility can provide the decisive advantage in both PvP and PvE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/9ee08759b266caedae48ae8b2e1ffe1c.poster.avif?t=1785908297\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/9ee08759b266caedae48ae8b2e1ffe1c.webm?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/9ee08759b266caedae48ae8b2e1ffe1c.mp4?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Own Dedicated Server</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Server Settings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player count, camera settings, max dino spawns, password, PvP or PvE mode, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/3a95a5be6bf4c00a715767b90abee3f3.poster.avif?t=1785908297\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/3a95a5be6bf4c00a715767b90abee3f3.webm?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/3a95a5be6bf4c00a715767b90abee3f3.mp4?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether solo or with friends – <i>Mesorift Survival</i> challenges you to survive, explore, and conquer in a brutal, untamed world.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/964e7b4cf206b38c9e2a6bb71f760946.avif?t=1785908297\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\