ore_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/9ee08759b266caedae48ae8b2e1ffe1c.mp4?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Own Dedicated Server</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Server Settings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player count, camera settings, max dino spawns, password, PvP or PvE mode, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/3a95a5be6bf4c00a715767b90abee3f3.poster.avif?t=1785908297\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/3a95a5be6bf4c00a715767b90abee3f3.webm?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/3a95a5be6bf4c00a715767b90abee3f3.mp4?t=1785908297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether solo or with friends – <i>Mesorift Survival</i> challenges you to survive, explore, and conquer in a brutal, untamed world.</p>", "short_description": "Mesorift Survival is a classic survival game with PvP and PvE elements, set in a tropical open world with three islands. Gather resources, build a base, craft weapons, and survive.", "supported_languages": "English, German, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/91c2b3ed55deda618ea66180bff4b2947fb48e1b/header.jpg?t=1785908297", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/1f0f33a17d69a77bd95c26c71249cc4b77a31482/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785908297", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/37906